# Messages the witnesses wrote, kept by scripts/check_cms.py --record.
# The keys and certificates are the ones they were made for; ca.crt
# issued every certificate. `expect` is the file the content must equal,
# compared in canonical form (CRLF) when `canonical` is yes.
# The password is 636f727265637420686f727365206261747465727920737461706c65 (hex of its UTF-8), the
# shared key's id is 6b656b2d31.

